{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"经典Galois理论"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"经典 Galois 理论"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>经典 Galois 理论告诉我们, 域的"},{"Local":{"url":"平展意象","text":"平展意象"}},{"Plain":"等价于其"},{"Local":{"url":"绝对Galois群","text":"绝对 Galois 群"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"分类意象","text":"分类意象"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>具体地, 对于域 $k$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"平展意象","text":"平展意象"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal X = \\mathsf{Sh} ((\\operatorname{Spec}k)_{\\mathrm{\\'et}})$,\n有 "},{"Local":{"url":"pro-对象","text":"pro-"}},{"Plain":"$1$-群胚的典范同构\n$$\r\n\\mathbf{B}{\\operatorname{Gal}(k^{\\mathrm{sep}}/k)}\r\n\\simeq\r\n\\Pi_1 \\mathcal X,\r\n$$\n并且典范的"},{"Local":{"url":"几何态射","text":"几何态射"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\mathcal X \\to\\beta(\\Pi_1\\mathcal X)\r\n$$\n为等价, 其中</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\Pi_1 = \\tau_{\\leq 1}\\circ\\Pi_{\\infty}\\colon \\mathsf{Topos} \\to \\mathsf{Pro}(\\mathsf{Ani}_{\\leq 1})$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"∞-意象的形","text":"形"}},{"Plain":"的基本 $1$-群胚,</li>\n<li>$\\beta\\colon \\mathsf{Pro}(\\mathsf{Ani}_{\\leq 1}) \\to \\mathsf{Topos}_1$ 为 $\\Pi_1$ 的右伴随.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"Galois扩张","text":null}},{"Plain":"</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}